        "topic": "TALK_EXODII_MERCHANT_netherum_labyrinth_exodii_wrist_computer"
      },
      {
        "text": "You wanted to ask me some questions earlier, and I think I was rude about it.  What did you want to ask?",
        "condition": {
          "and": [
            { "not": { "test_eoc": "EOC_CONDITION_XE_YOU_ARE_FAIR_FOLK" } },
